msgid ""
"After clicking <guilabel>Submit</guilabel>, a progress bar will appear and "
"will be updated with the status of the board installation. Please be patient"
" as this may take a few moments."
msgstr ""
"Dopo aver cliccato su <guilabel>Invia</guilabel>, apparirà una barra di "
